  "system": {
    "description": "<p><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">While Berserk, your attack damage dice are one size larger and you reduce damage you take by 1 per damage die if you are wearing Light or no Armor.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">Further, you can go Berserk when you take damage or attack an Enemy. You remain Berserk this way for 1 minute, or until you end your Turn without attacking an Enemy or taking damage since your last Turn.</span></p>",
